      <floats-group id="article-63338.s9">
        <fig id="article-63338.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Choreiform Gait.&#x000a0;Choreiform gait, involuntary movement, is the&#x000a0;primary feature of Huntington disease, chronic rheumatoid disease, and Sydenham chorea. Contributed by RS. Menon, MD&#x000a0;</p>
          </caption>
